+         错误 `↯/s.105.3`：_the keystore operation failed because `reason`_。
+     entry .communicable   把每个原因呈现为一条消息
+     entry .Reason   操作失败的原因
+         `Unreadable`（1）：_the keystore could not be read with the given password_——口令错误或密钥库损坏，有意不加区分。
+         `WriteUnsupported`（2）：_keystores cannot yet be opened for writing_，针对 `open[Keystore](Write, …)`。
+     entry #reason   操作失败的原因

